{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The `tool_loop` command orchestrates an autonomous development cycle by engaging an LLM in a recursive loop to solve complex tasks using available Newbound tools. ROUND LIMIT: the agent's TOOL_BUDGET, read live (floor 24, cap 1000). On budget exhaustion it self-summarizes a resumable checkpoint. Aborts on repeated-identical-calls and 3 consecutive identical failures. COMPLETION GATE (2026-10): the final STATUS: DONE is accepted only if (a) a VERIFIED: evidence line is present AND (b) a bounded model-graded goal-scope check (via ask_llm) confirms the evidence satisfies the WHOLE GOAL, not a phase/increment; the check is fail-closed (error/PARTIAL/ambiguous => IN_PROGRESS, never DONE) and is skipped unless a DONE is claimed, so IN_PROGRESS/BLOCKED turns pay nothing. Returns FLAT {msg, messages}.","import":"use flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse crate::agent::llm::chat_llm::chat_llm;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"name":"prompt","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"lnmvtl19edbeb72a7tc3a","readers":[],"time":1792758736537,"username":"system","writers":[]}